OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation into death of man
OL,4,Atasered by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police watchdog is investigating
OL,7,Ffollowing the death of a man who was
OL,8,Ftasered by an officer.
OL,10,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) were
OL,11,Fcalled to the 43-year-old's property in
OL,12,FBolton at about 23:10 BST on Wednesday
OL,13,F8 October.
OL,15,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,16,FConduct (IOPC) confirmed officers found
OL,17,Fthe man bleeding heavily and refusing
OL,18,Fto drop a pair of scissors, leading to
OL,19,Fa Taser being discharged.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
